-~> icons: the editor's 8x8 pixel icons as data. A row of the picture is one
-~> text of 8 characters, "#" is a set pixel, and the rows are joined by "|".
-~> An icon has one color and is tinted when it is drawn (see g_icon).
-~> The pictures come from the approved design.

